'Energy identity and decay','uᵀLu=Σ_(i<j)w_ij(u_i−u_j)²≥0. Along heat flow,d(||u||²/2)/dt=−uᵀLu≤0. On the orthogonal complement of componentwise constants, decay is exponential at the smallest positive eigenvalue.',
